---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Pricing · WEBAO · One simple plan, $149 CAD/month"
  description="One plan that includes everything: a custom 3 to 5 page site, domain, hosting, SEO basics, analytics, updates, and support. No setup fee, no long-term contract."
>
  <!-- Header intro -->
  <section class="pricing-hero grain">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="pricing-hero-grid">
        <div data-reveal>
          <div class="eyebrow">Pricing · One plan, nothing to decode</div>
          <h1 class="display" style="font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6.5vw, 5.6rem); line-height:.88; margin-top:12px;">
            One plan.<br />
            <span style="font-style: italic; font-weight:400; color: var(--accent);">Everything</span> included.
          </h1>
          <p class="prose" style="margin-top:16px; max-width: 52ch;">
            We kept it simple on purpose. Most small businesses need the same thing: a credible, findable site that stays up to date. One plan covers that for $149 a month, with no setup fee.
          </p>
          <div class="cluster" style="margin-top:18px;">
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Start your site →</a>
            <span class="mono" style="font-size:11px; color: var(--muted);">Questions first? Email hello@webao.ca</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pricing-hero-card" data-reveal style="--d:120ms">
          <div class="mono" style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.14em; opacity:.5;">THE WEBAO PLAN</div>
          <div style="display:flex; align-items: baseline; gap:8px; margin-top:12px;">
            <span class="display" style="font-size: 3.8rem; line-height:.9;">$149</span>
            <span class="mono" style="font-size:11px; line-height:1.3; opacity:.6;">CAD / month<br />+ applicable taxes</span>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:10px; font-size:13px; color: var(--muted);">For most trades, shops, restaurants, and local services. 3–5 pages, designed around your business.</div>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--dark" style="width:100%; margin-top:18px; justify-content:center;">Get started →</a>
          <div class="mono" style="margin-top:10px; font-size:11px; text-align:center; color: var(--muted);">No setup fee · No long-term contract</div>
          <div class="trust-row">
            <span>◐ SSL</span><span>◑ Backups</span><span>◎ CDN</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Comparison -->
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 28px;">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="compare" data-reveal>
        <div class="compare-head">
          <h2>What you get, and what you never have to think about</h2>
          <p class="mono">Everything a local business site actually needs. Nothing you’ll never use.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="compare-grid">
          <!-- Included -->
          <div class="compare-card compare-card--included">
            <div class="compare-label mono">INCLUDED IN YOUR $149</div>
            <ul role="list">
              <li><span class="ic">✓</span><div><strong>Custom 3–5 page design</strong><span>Home plus 2–4 pages (Services, About, Contact, and so on). Designed around your trade, not a template.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic">✓</span><div><strong>Your own domain</strong><span>Registered for your business and yours to keep. We handle configuration, SSL, and renewals while you’re subscribed. Email forwarding included.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic">✓</span><div><strong>Hosting, SSL, CDN</strong><span>Served from a global CDN, so the site loads quickly for customers anywhere in Canada.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic">✓</span><div><strong>Mobile, SEO basics, analytics</strong><span>Mobile-first design, clean markup, sitemap, and analytics. We can also help set up your Google Business Profile. Fundamentals, not ranking promises.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic">✓</span><div><strong>Contact / quote form</strong><span>Messages arrive in your inbox with basic spam protection. No third-party widget that breaks.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic">✓</span><div><strong>Backups & security</strong><span>Backups, updates, and monitoring are part of the service. If something breaks, we fix it.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic">✓</span><div><strong>Small updates included</strong><span>Hours, photos, prices, promos: send an email and we make the change. No CMS to learn, no per-change billing.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic">✓</span><div><strong>Human support</strong><span>You talk directly with the person doing the work, by email, Monday to Friday (Eastern Time).</span></div></li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Not included / extra -->
          <div class="compare-card compare-card--muted">
            <div class="compare-label mono">NOT IN THE PLAN · QUOTED IF YOU NEED IT</div>
            <ul role="list">
              <li><span class="ic ic--dash">×</span><div><strong>Extra pages or languages</strong><span>More pages or a second language: possible, quoted case by case, with a clear price before any work starts.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic ic--dash">×</span><div><strong>E-commerce / booking systems</strong><span>Online stores and complex booking aren’t part of the base plan. If you need one, we’ll talk options and quote it separately.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic ic--dash">×</span><div><strong>Full brand identity</strong><span>A wordmark and color palette that fit your site are included. A complete identity (logo suite, brand guidelines) is not.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic ic--dash">×</span><div><strong>Copywriting from scratch</strong><span>We edit and shape the text you send. Writing all of your copy from scratch is a separate service, quoted upfront.</span></div></li>
              <li><span class="ic ic--dash">×</span><div><strong>Ads / social media</strong><span>We don’t run or sell ads. We focus on the organic fundamentals: your site and your Google Business Profile.</span></div></li>
            </ul>

            <div class="callout">
              <div style="font-weight:700; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Most local businesses don’t need the extras.</div>
              <p style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color: var(--muted); margin-top:6px;">The plan is built for electricians, plumbers, landscapers, restaurants, and clinics. If yours needs more, we’ll say so upfront and quote it clearly.</p>
              <a href="/contact" style="display:inline-flex; margin-top:12px; font-weight:650; font-size:13px; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset:3px;">Ask for a tailored quote →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="compare-foot mono" data-reveal>
          <span>YOUR SITE, YOUR DOMAIN · If you ever leave, we help with the handoff.</span>
          <span style="opacity:.5;">→ No page-builder account to untangle, no hosting you have to migrate alone.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Process + timeline -->
  <section class="section section--dark grain" style="padding-block: clamp(40px,6vw,80px);">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="timeline-grid" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow" style="color: rgba(248,245,239,.5);">The typical timeline</div>
          <h2 class="display" style="font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); margin-top:10px; line-height:.92; color: var(--paper);">From “we need a site”<br /><span style="font-style: italic; font-weight:400; color: #FF8A7A;">to “it’s live”.</span></h2>
          <p style="margin-top:14px; color: rgba(248,245,239,.64); font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; max-width: 42ch;">You send the basics. We do the work. One round of feedback. Then we launch and keep it maintained.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <ol class="timeline" role="list">
            <li><span class="t-n">1</span><div><strong>Day 0 · You send the basics</strong><span>Photos, services, area, logo (if you have one). A 15-minute call or the contact form.</span></div></li>
            <li><span class="t-n">2</span><div><strong>Day 2 · Private preview</strong><span>A real URL on your phone. Click everything. Tell us what feels off.</span></div></li>
            <li><span class="t-n">3</span><div><strong>Day 4 · Revisions</strong><span>We polish typography, copy, photos, and SEO basics in one focused round.</span></div></li>
            <li><span class="t-n">4</span><div><strong>Day 5–7 · Launch</strong><span>Domain, hosting, SSL, analytics. We flip the switch and send you the “it’s live” message.</span></div></li>
          </ol>
          <p class="mono" style="margin-top:10px; font-size:11px; color: rgba(248,245,239,.5); line-height:1.6;">TYPICAL, NOT GUARANTEED · THE CLOCK STARTS WHEN WE HAVE YOUR CONTENT, AND FEEDBACK SPEED MOVES THE DATE.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Billing breakdown -->
  <section class="section grain">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="quote-card" data-reveal>
        <div class="quote-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="invoice">
            <div class="mono" style="font-size:10px; opacity:.5;">YOUR BILL · EVERY MONTH</div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline;">
              <span style="font-weight:750; letter-spacing:-0.02em;">The WEBAO plan</span>
              <span class="mono" style="font-size:11px; background: var(--ink); color:white; padding:4px 8px; border-radius:99px;">ALL-IN</span>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:12px; height:1px; background: var(--line);"></div>
            <div style="margin-top:12px; display:grid; gap:8px; font-size:13px;">
              <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between;"><span>Design, domain, hosting, updates, support</span><span style="font-weight:650;">$149.00</span></div>
              <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; color: var(--muted);"><span>Setup fee</span><span>$0.00</span></div>
              <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; color: var(--muted);"><span>Hosting & SSL add-ons</span><span>$0.00</span></div>
              <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; color: var(--muted);"><span>Small update charges</span><span>$0.00</span></div>
              <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-weight:750; border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding-top:8px; margin-top:4px;"><span>Total</span><span>$149 + taxes</span></div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:14px; background: var(--paper-2); border-radius:10px; padding:10px; font-size:12px; line-height:1.5; color: var(--muted);">Billed monthly. Anything beyond the plan is quoted and approved by you first.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="quote-copy">
          <div class="eyebrow">The whole bill, every month</div>
          <h2 class="display" style="font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.6rem); margin-top:10px; line-height:.92;">Predictable.<br />Boring (in a good way).</h2>
          <p class="prose" style="margin-top:12px; font-size:14.5px;">No intro pricing that doubles later, no itemized surprises. You know the price before we start, and it stays that price unless your needs change and you approve a quote.</p>
          <ul class="check-list">
            <li>→ Monthly billing, no long-term contract</li>
            <li>→ Your domain belongs to your business</li>
            <li>→ If you leave, we help with the handoff</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary" style="margin-top:16px;">Start at $149/mo →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ mini -->
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="faq-compact" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="display" style="font-size:1.6rem; line-height:1;">Common questions about pricing</h3>
        <div class="faq-mini-grid">
          <details open><summary>What if I need a 6th page later?</summary><div><p>Tell us what you need and we’ll give you a clear price before doing the work. If you want it maintained with everything else, we’ll fold it into your plan.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>Do you charge for photos or copy tweaks?</summary><div><p>Small updates (swap a photo, fix your hours, add a service) are included. Bigger projects like a full copy rewrite or brand-new pages are quoted upfront, and you decide.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>What about email (info@…)?</summary><div><p>We set up forwarding, so info@yourdomain.ca arrives in the inbox you already use. That’s different from full mailbox hosting: if you want mailboxes with webmail and calendars, that comes from an email provider like Google or Microsoft, paid to them directly. We’ll help connect it.</p></div></details>
          <details><summary>Can I pay yearly?</summary><div><p>Billing is monthly for now. If annual billing matters to you, mention it when we talk and we’ll see what we can do.</p></div></details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-band grain" style="padding-block: 40px;">
    <div class="shell" style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:16px; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;">
      <div>
        <div class="mono" style="color: rgba(248,245,239,.5); font-size:11px;">READY WHEN YOU ARE</div>
        <h2 class="display" style="font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); margin-top:6px; color: var(--paper);">Start at $149. <span style="font-style: italic; font-weight:400; color:#FF8A7A;">Everything included.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="cluster">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary" style="background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink);">Start your site →</a>
        <a href="/demos" class="btn" style="color: var(--paper); border-color: rgba(248,245,239,.18);">See demos first</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .pricing-hero {
      padding-block: clamp(32px, 6vw, 72px);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--paper) 0%, var(--paper-2) 100%);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .pricing-hero-grid {
      display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr; gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 40px); align-items: start;
    }
    .pricing-hero-card {
      background: white; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:20px; padding:20px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      position: sticky; top: calc(var(--header-h) + 16px);
    }
    .trust-row { margin-top:16px; display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.06em; color: var(--muted); }
    .trust-row span { background: var(--paper-2); border:1px solid var(--line); padding:6px 8px; border-radius:99px; }

    .compare { display:grid; gap:18px; }
    .compare-head h2 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem); letter-spacing:-0.02em; font-weight:750; line-height:1.1; }
    .compare-head p { margin-top:6px; font-size:12px; color: var(--muted); }
    .compare-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr; gap:16px; align-items:start; }
    .compare-card { background:white; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:18px; padding:18px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); }
    .compare-card--muted { background: var(--paper-2); }
    .compare-label { font-size:10px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom:10px; }
    .compare-card ul { list-style:none; padding:0; display:grid; gap:14px; }
    .compare-card li { display:grid; grid-template-columns: 28px 1fr; gap:10px; align-items:start; }
    .ic { width:26px; height:26px; border-radius:99px; background: var(--ink); color:white; display:grid; place-items:center; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; flex:none; }
    .ic--dash { background: var(--paper-2); color: var(--ink); border:1px solid var(--line); }
    .compare-card li strong { display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:-0.02em; line-height:1.25; }
    .compare-card li span { display:block; font-size:13px; line-height:1.55; color: var(--muted); margin-top:2px; }
    .callout { margin-top:18px; background:white; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px; padding:14px; }
    .compare-foot { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px; justify-content:space-between; padding:12px 14px; background: var(--ink); color: rgba(248,245,239,.7); border-radius:12px; font-size:11px; }

    .timeline-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr; gap: 24px; align-items:start; }
    .timeline { list-style:none; padding:0; display:grid; gap:10px; }
    .timeline li { display:grid; grid-template-columns: 44px 1fr; gap:14px; align-items:start; background: rgba(248,245,239,.06); border:1px solid var(--line-on-dark); border-radius:14px; padding:14px; }
    .t-n { width:36px; height:36px; border-radius:10px; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); display:grid; place-items:center; font-weight:750; font-size:13px; }
    .timeline li strong { display:block; color: var(--paper); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:-0.01em; }
    .timeline li span { display:block; color: rgba(248,245,239,.6); font-size:13px; line-height:1.5; margin-top:2px; }

    .quote-card { display:grid; grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr; gap:24px; align-items:center; background:white; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:18px; padding:18px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); }
    .invoice { background: var(--paper-3); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px; padding:16px; }
    .check-list { list-style:none; padding:0; margin-top:12px; display:grid; gap:6px; font-size:13px; color: var(--muted); }
    .faq-compact { background: var(--paper-2); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:16px; padding:18px; }
    .faq-mini-grid { margin-top:14px; display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap:10px; }
    .faq-mini-grid details { background:white; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px; overflow:clip; }
    .faq-mini-grid summary { padding:14px; font-weight:650; font-size:13.5px; cursor:pointer; list-style:none; }
    .faq-mini-grid summary::-webkit-details-marker{ display:none; }
    .faq-mini-grid details div { padding:0 14px 14px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color: var(--muted); border-top:1px solid var(--line); margin-top:6px; padding-top:10px; }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .pricing-hero-grid, .compare-grid, .timeline-grid, .quote-card, .faq-mini-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .pricing-hero-card { position: static; }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
